module test.claim.hostname_allocation_witness

// IMPORTS ADDED 2026-11-10 (gunbc.plans.fleet_machine_authority P2). Before this the file named nothing it
// used and resolved only through the retired flat namespace, so at main it refused at resolve and none of
// its claims ran.
